<!--
  Analog dial for a dark-ink collection.

  A thin ring and four marks, which is the whole face: numerals and a sixty-tick track do not
  survive being drawn at widget size, and a cluttered dial is what makes an analog clock widget
  read as a stock Android sample.
-->
